#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Depth"
msgstr "Gate Cutting zur Reduzierung der Circuit-Tiefe"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-"
"addons/cutting/02_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_depth.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-"
"addons/cutting/02_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_depth.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, we will reduce a circuit's depth by cutting distant gates,"
" avoiding the swap gates that would otherwise be introduced by routing.\n"
msgstr ""
"In diesem Tutorial werden wir die Tiefe eines Circuits reduzieren, indem wir"
" entfernte Gates schneiden und so die SWAP-Gates vermeiden, die andernfalls "
"durch das Routing eingeführt würden.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These are the steps that we will take in this [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns):\n"
msgstr ""
"Dies sind die Schritte, die wir in diesem [Qiskit-"
"Muster](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) "
"durchführen werden:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Schritt 1: Problem auf Quantum Circuits und Operatoren abbilden**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Den Hamiltonian auf einen Quantum Circuit abbilden.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Schritt 2: Für die Zielhardware optimieren** [_Verwendet das Cutting-"
"Addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Den Circuit und das Observable schneiden.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "Die Teilexperimente für die Hardware transpilieren.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Schritt 3: Auf der Zielhardware ausführen**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die in Schritt 2 erhaltenen Teilexperimente mit einem `Sampler`-Primitiv "
"ausführen.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Schritt 4: Ergebnisse nachverarbeiten** [_Verwendet das Cutting-Addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the "
"expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Die Ergebnisse aus Schritt 3 kombinieren, um den "
"Erwartungswert des betreffenden Observables zu rekonstruieren.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Schritt 1: Abbilden {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a circuit to run on the backend {#create-a-circuit-to-run-on-the-"
"backend}"
msgstr ""
"Einen Circuit erstellen, der auf dem Backend ausgeführt wird {#create-a-"
"circuit-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-depth/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-depth/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Ein Observable festlegen {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Schritt 2: Optimieren {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Specify a backend {#specify-a-backend}"
msgstr "Ein Backend festlegen {#specify-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can provide either a fake backend or a hardware backend from Qiskit "
"Runtime.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst entweder ein Fake-Backend oder ein Hardware-Backend von Qiskit "
"Runtime angeben.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Transpile the circuit, visualize the swaps, and note the depth {#transpile-"
"the-circuit-visualize-the-swaps-and-note-the-depth}"
msgstr ""
"Den Circuit transpilieren, die Swaps visualisieren und die Tiefe notieren "
"{#transpile-the-circuit-visualize-the-swaps-and-note-the-depth}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We choose a layout that requires two swaps to execute the gates between "
"qubits 3 and 0 and another two swaps to return the qubits to their initial "
"positions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wir wählen ein Layout, das zwei Swaps erfordert, um die Gates zwischen "
"Qubits 3 und 0 auszuführen, und weitere zwei Swaps, um die Qubits in ihre "
"Ausgangspositionen zurückzubringen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-depth/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-depth/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Replace distant gates with `TwoQubitQPDGate`s by specifying their indices "
"{#replace-distant-gates-with-twoqubitqpdgates-by-specifying-their-indices}"
msgstr ""
"Entfernte Gates durch `TwoQubitQPDGate`s ersetzen, indem ihre Indizes "
"angegeben werden {#replace-distant-gates-with-twoqubitqpdgates-by-"
"specifying-their-indices}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`cut_gates` will replace the gates in the specified indices with "
"`TwoQubitQPDGate`s and also return a list of `QPDBasis` instances -- one for"
" each gate decomposition.\n"
msgstr ""
"`cut_gates` ersetzt die Gates an den angegebenen Indizes durch "
"`TwoQubitQPDGate`s und gibt außerdem eine Liste von `QPDBasis`-Instanzen "
"zurück – eine für jede Gate-Dekomposition.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-depth/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-depth/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-"
"subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr ""
"Die Teilexperimente generieren, die auf dem Backend ausgeführt werden sollen"
" {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts a circuit containing "
"`TwoQubitQPDGate` instances and observables as a `PauliList`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`generate_cutting_experiments` akzeptiert einen Circuit, der "
"`TwoQubitQPDGate`-Instanzen enthält, und Observables als `PauliList`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many "
"subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint "
"quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The"
" number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by "
"`num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample."
" For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the "
"[explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr ""
"Um den Erwartungswert des vollständigen Circuits zu simulieren, werden viele"
" Teilexperimente aus der gemeinsamen Quasiwahrscheinlichkeitsverteilung der "
"zerlegten Gates generiert und anschließend auf einem oder mehreren Backends "
"ausgeführt. Die Anzahl der aus der Verteilung entnommenen Stichproben wird "
"durch `num_samples` gesteuert, und für jede eindeutige Stichprobe wird ein "
"kombinierter Koeffizient angegeben. Weitere Informationen zur Berechnung der"
" Koeffizienten findest du im "
"[Erläuterungsmaterial](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note:** The ``observables`` kwarg to `generate_cutting_experiments` is of "
"type `PauliList`. Observable term coefficients and phases are ignored during"
" decomposition of the problem and execution of the subexperiments. They may "
"be re-applied during reconstruction of the expectation value.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Hinweis:** Das ``observables``-Schlüsselwortargument für "
"`generate_cutting_experiments` hat den Typ `PauliList`. Koeffizienten und "
"Phasen der Observable-Terme werden bei der Zerlegung des Problems und der "
"Ausführung der Teilexperimente ignoriert. Sie können bei der Rekonstruktion "
"des Erwartungswertes erneut angewendet werden.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-"
"sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr ""
"Den Sampling-Overhead für die gewählten Schnitte berechnen {#calculate-the-"
"sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we cut three CNOT gates, resulting in a sampling overhead of $9^3$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hier schneiden wir drei CNOT-Gates, was zu einem Sampling-Overhead von $9^3$"
" führt.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the "
"[explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr ""
"Weitere Informationen zum durch Circuit Cutting entstehenden Sampling-"
"Overhead findest du im [Erläuterungsmaterial](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Demonstrate that the QPD subexperiments will be shallower after cutting "
"distant gates {#demonstrate-that-the-qpd-subexperiments-will-be-shallower-"
"after-cutting-distant-gates}"
msgstr ""
"Demonstrieren, dass die QPD-Teilexperimente nach dem Schneiden entfernter "
"Gates flacher sein werden {#demonstrate-that-the-qpd-subexperiments-will-be-"
"shallower-after-cutting-distant-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here is an example of an arbitrarily chosen subexperiment generated from the"
" QPD circuit. Its depth has been reduced by more than half. Many of these "
"probabilistic subexperiments must be generated and evaluated in order to "
"reconstruct an expectation value of the deeper circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hier ist ein Beispiel eines beliebig gewählten Teilexperiments, das aus dem "
"QPD-Circuit generiert wurde. Seine Tiefe wurde um mehr als die Hälfte "
"reduziert. Viele dieser probabilistischen Teilexperimente müssen generiert "
"und ausgewertet werden, um einen Erwartungswert des tieferen Circuits zu "
"rekonstruieren.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-depth/output_4.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-"
"reduce-circuit-depth/output_4.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Prepare subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-subexperiments-for-the-"
"backend}"
msgstr ""
"Teilexperimente für das Backend vorbereiten {#prepare-subexperiments-for-"
"the-backend}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Schritt 3: Ausführen {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-"
"subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr ""
"Die Teilexperimente mit dem Qiskit Runtime Sampler-Primitiv ausführen {#run-"
"the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Schritt 4: Nachverarbeitung {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr ""
"Den Erwartungswert rekonstruieren {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to "
"reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Erwartungswerte für jeden Observable-Term rekonstruieren und kombinieren, um"
" den Erwartungswert für das ursprüngliche Observable zu rekonstruieren.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value"
" from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-"
"expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-"
"circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr ""
"Den rekonstruierten Erwartungswert mit dem exakten Erwartungswert aus dem "
"ursprünglichen Circuit und Observable vergleichen {#compare-the-"
"reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-"
"original-circuit-and-observable}"

